WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.601
-Guys, it is time for "Tonight Show Hashtags."

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.000
Here we go.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.667
-♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:08.133
♪♪

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:09.734
♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:09.734 --> 00:00:12.200
♪♪

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.834
-Now, we do this thing every week where I send out a hashtag

00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:17.067
and ask you guys to respond to that topic.

00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:18.834
With the Oscars happening this weekend,

00:00:18.834 --> 00:00:21.267
I sent out the hashtag "IDeserveAnAward."

00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:23.968
And I asked you guys to tweet out a funny or weird thing

00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:26.234
that you think you deserve an award for.

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:28.734
Within minutes, it was a trending topic in the U.S.,

00:00:28.734 --> 00:00:30.868
so thank you for playing along.

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:33.200
And now I thought I'd share some of my favorite

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.234
#IDeserveAnAward tweets from you guys.

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:38.767
Here we go. This first one's from @Sohnzie. She says...

00:00:42.434 --> 00:00:44.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:44.334 --> 00:00:46.167
That's hard to do. That's self-control.

00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:47.934
-That's an award. Yeah.

00:00:47.934 --> 00:00:50.501
-This one's from @DunLahfAtMae. [don't laugh at me]

00:00:50.501 --> 00:00:52.767
-Ahh. [Valley girl accent] What does this say?

00:00:52.767 --> 00:00:56.434
-D-U-N-L-A-H-F -- Anyway. Dunlahf.

00:00:56.434 --> 00:00:58.367
-Dunlahf. -She says...

00:01:03.534 --> 00:01:06.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:06.801 --> 00:01:10.200
At least you're polite. -Yeah.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:13.734
-This one's from @thefabulouspot6. She says...

00:01:17.968 --> 00:01:19.267
Ooh.

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:21.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:21.801 --> 00:01:23.000
-Hot!

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:27.200
-This one's from @sophierhi13. She says...

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:34.601 --> 00:01:39.033
"How fresh is the, uh, muttza-rell?"

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:41.100
Manna-got.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:44.534
-Gabbagol. -Gabbagool.

00:01:44.534 --> 00:01:46.501
They're like, "Yeah, we don't say that in Italy."

00:01:46.501 --> 00:01:47.701
-Yeah.

00:01:47.701 --> 00:01:50.033
-This one's from @elise-millsssss.

00:01:50.033 --> 00:01:51.234
They say...

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:57.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:01.567 --> 00:02:04.634
This one's from @lasbishopmusic. They say...

00:02:09.467 --> 00:02:10.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:10.901 --> 00:02:13.767
That's a -- That's a superpower.

00:02:13.767 --> 00:02:15.133
Boom!

00:02:15.133 --> 00:02:18.868
This last one is from @2much2do55. She says...

00:02:18.868 --> 00:02:20.467
"I'm a teacher."

00:02:20.467 --> 00:02:23.033
-Yeah! -That's right. That's right.

00:02:23.033 --> 00:02:24.701
Those are our "Tonight Show Hashtags."

00:02:24.701 --> 00:02:26.234
To check out more of our favorites,

00:02:26.234 --> 00:02:28.300
go to tonightshow.com/hashtags.

